## Key Concepts

- Articulated 6-DoF pose estimation for hinged objects
- Hinge-state (open/closed) inference
- Synthetic+real data with domain adaptation
- Few-shot on-device fine-tuning
- Real-time edge deployment considerations

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pose error metric example (illustrative)
function poseError(est, gt) {
  // est/gt: {R: rotation matrix, t: translation vector}
  const rotError = rotationDistance(est.R, gt.R);
  const transError = vectorDistance(est.t, gt.t);
  return { rotError, transError };
}
```

